hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2960","[First narration chain:] Narrated to us Ahmad ibn Abdah al-Dhabbi, from Hammad ibn Zayd, from Amru. [Second narration chain:] And narrated to us Sa'id ibn Abd al-Rahman, who narrated to us Sufyan, from Amru, from Nafi' ibn Jubair ibn Mut'im, from Bishr ibn Suhaim (RA), that the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) ordered him to make a proclamation during the days of Tashriq. Al-Mukharrami said: He (the Prophet ﷺ) sent him during the days of Mina to announce: ""No one will enter Paradise except a believing soul, and indeed these are days of eating and drinking."" [Compiler's note: I have extracted this chapter in its full form in the Book of Fasting.]
---"
